{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "233776660d63fee83e734310eeb9786fe129cf53cb010863162b017a0f47ec1f", "ja": "とりあえず、パートナー", "zh": "姑且先定为搭档", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "236993d74ea4f3f81d1f4e4cc1235305046020d99b596eba77476380ff60e18b", "ja": "新曲の歌い手に、可憐を推薦する律子。だが\n第一印象は律子だったとプロデューサーは言\nい、公演のメンバー達も頷く。戸惑う律子に\n可憐は、ふたりなら勇気が出せると言う。律\n子はとりあえずの代役ならと引き受ける。", "zh": "律子推荐可怜担任新歌的演唱者。但制作人说，第一印象中的人选是律子，公演的成员们也纷纷点头。面对困惑的律子，可怜表示两个人一起就能鼓起勇气。律子答应了下来，说暂时代演的话倒是可以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8c178fc2b9f90afbfa7c31f8878316a7dedc93950a72de7b5efd21b1a22bf003", "ja": "（今日は、地方公演のレッスンだ。課題は\nいろいろあるが、ひとつひとつ片付けていこう）", "zh": "（今天是地方公演的练习。虽然还有各种各样的问题要解决，但就一个一个处理吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "ab74afb208fc6e5a95cdd9dcd52688e552f720b96fb4b3c140705c29a605e48a", "ja": "あ、{$P$}、来ましたね！\n私からひとつ、提案があるんですけど……ふふっ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，您来了！\n我有个提议……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3eef5e5672f0ebe8b4185857bfbd1961bd7cdac6125687c5851e7b69329a6ce9", "ja": "律子、その顔は……\n何かいい事を思い付いたって感じか？", "zh": "律子，看你这表情……\n是想到了什么好主意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "834e200af97bf45bd14e6e0fdec01df2c4a2e2918da180d230855779f412268d", "ja": "あはは、わかります？　ほら、この前\n聴かせてもらった、新曲のことなんですけど……。", "zh": "啊哈哈，看出来了吗？你看，是关于之前让我听过的那首新歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "83bc01f62a674b073482c8e7a8d85857c2f1b4536fba1b8d954d4b114d254d57", "ja": "誰が歌うか、まだ決まってませんよね？\n可憐なんてどうですか？", "zh": "还没决定由谁来唱，对吧？让可怜来唱怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f1e8e03f2a6c72be0d3425bf74ef2a9d323ae74e67b770b776f064faa057f536", "ja": "なるほど可憐か……。\nそうだな、悪くないかもしれない。", "zh": "原来是可怜啊……\n嗯，或许也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "adbc7314366234702df2ac0ec81bbea362af50e861112cbac59c7a652b96ba99", "ja": "え、ええ……！？\nし、新曲って……わ、私が、ですか……？", "zh": "诶、诶诶……！？\n新、新歌是指……我、我来唱吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "e476e79259ee6e2ee5ab5a44b801ffc660cd39a1700b5d6cb9a294f75a5743b7", "ja": "そうよ、可憐。でも、何か他に意見があるなら、\nはっきり言ってみていいのよ。", "zh": "没错，可怜。不过，如果你还有什么别的意见，也可以直截了当地说出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "aff80c8084fcc4cdb930aa135b84a372367d1e83cfcc8a6e16140c0b91e80c0f", "ja": "私みたいに、口やかましくなれとまでは言わないけど\n……可憐はもっと、意見を言えるようにならなくちゃ。", "zh": "我倒不是要求你也像我一样变得这么爱唠叨……但可怜，你得学会更好地表达自己的意见才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "0845c0fc3f8acaadbf2c3a0747341803d32d3ab2af28b1588bea82a2f8f3a0d5", "ja": "い、意見を……で、でも、あの、私……。\nうぅっ。", "zh": "意、意见……可、可是，那个，我……。\n呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1010_030iku", "source_sha256": "28e3c6873f39262a252aa7d12f09b7de79fdb38ba0b394cf53b8b16accf8498d", "ja": "ねえねえ{$P$}さん、新曲あるの？\nわたし、聴いてみたい！", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}先生，有新歌吗？\n我也想听听！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "d1c3f4ab39d0a2e02f234e84f10b7f4d5b12d60efaf6f2920df72ba5dcbfc6fd", "ja": "あ、あの、仕掛け人さま……！\n私も、聴いてみたいです！", "zh": "啊、那个，制作人先生……！\n我也想听听看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "e473f9229e0db8844af566735a693e8a6075ecb0396d0138a3525e6d182a67f4", "ja": "ええ、そうね。\nどんな曲なのか、私も気になります。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。\n我也很想知道那会是一首什么样的歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5d5d267d30f66a46522e35b6eaa320215df33798b1865b8d7622bdf59f1471fb", "ja": "それじゃせっかくだし、みんなに聴いてもらおうかな。\n確かデータが……ええと。", "zh": "既然难得有这个机会，就让大家也听听吧。\n我记得数据应该在……呃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "25a0dd6086a906a71b1ccdba966cce7898e09c1a2124c17f52bb61def23185a5", "ja": "Wow！　素敵な曲ですね……！\n聴いていると、なんだか胸が高鳴るような……。", "zh": "Wow！真是一首美妙的曲子呢……！\n听着听着，总觉得胸口有些雀跃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "eed374eba2d273fa295a5f3427e8e4c96a3f19ed68006939050af9c04618173d", "ja": "うん……なんだろう？\nかわいいんだけど、ちょっと大人っぽいかも？", "zh": "嗯……怎么说呢？\n虽然很可爱，但又感觉有点像大人？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "ec0c6ca95052c3f843afcb3320ec47a78ec12fc78fd163ba2960d9a6d4878d89", "ja": "本当、素敵な曲ね。{$P$}さんは、\nこの歌を、誰に歌ってほしいと思っているんですか？", "zh": "真的，是一首很棒的歌呢。{$P$}先生，您希望谁来唱这首歌呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1018_p", "source_sha256": "75770e58b7bab470684ea2fd6a1db3739ffba5367b87efa5acd4281cf78a33e4", "ja": "第一印象では、律子ですね。", "zh": "第一印象的话，我觉得是律子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "eca763637c82b628f39a1f5654ddae6fde35d00064c3a7f09a2e664bd9923a4d", "ja": "ああ、なるほど……って、ええ！？　わ、私？\nあ、あれは冗談のはずじゃ……！", "zh": "啊，原来如此……等等，诶！？　我、我吗？\n那、那应该只是开玩笑吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "ae0a54a4a4b57525592d472c074d917a11034a4fe5119c6691bd3f41c8eeb25b", "ja": "律子さんかぁ……！　わたし、\n律子さんが歌うの、聴いてみたい！", "zh": "律子小姐啊……！我好想听听\n律子小姐唱歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "30dcb5d1a78878f4c23f7911ab446b95cb0dc3eb0acf56c5bd2ccb7c35e8f17f", "ja": "ち、ちょっと待って！　この曲でしょ？\nいくらなんでも、私にはかわいすぎるっていうか……。", "zh": "等、等一下！是这首歌吧？\n不管怎么说，对我来说也太可爱了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1022_010azu", "source_sha256": "34e30145727797629fe42bb5c7622cfc4ea2a3121c42ff791a893c578b147e24", "ja": "そうですか？　可憐ちゃんも合いそうだけど\nこの歌、律子さんにもとっても合うんじゃないかしら。", "zh": "是吗？我觉得可怜也很适合，不过这首歌，律子也非常合适呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1023_009rit", "source_sha256": "20297069a30c214e756d65e852f3a13e212bc10c096eee1cb623ad347b90cff1", "ja": "あ、あずささんまで……！", "zh": "啊，连梓酱也这么说……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1024_p", "source_sha256": "a60b5b9261275db61d6ef6f2fedd1d99f3c5dd472f03f3c7c052e71ddb9aa6e5", "ja": "やっぱり、そう思いますよね。もともとデュオを\n予定していたので、ふたりに歌ってもらおうかな。", "zh": "果然，您也是这么想的吧。原本就\n预定是双人组合，要不就让你们两位来唱吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1025_045kar", "source_sha256": "ca9206c5029c03701a2aa568e7e0f04d981845f59c02177f0c5605f7b30e60fb", "ja": "り、律子さんと、私が……デュオ……？\nそれなら、私……勇気が出せる、かも……。", "zh": "律、律子小姐和我……组成二重唱……？\n这样的话，我……也许就能鼓起勇气了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1026_009rit", "source_sha256": "f369ab19ada82fb323134040ab871ab6fe71b6eec87c080017ef77bdd018ad0f", "ja": "いやいや。{$P$}、\n私より、もっと向いてる子がいるでしょ？", "zh": "不不，{$P$}，比我更合适的人不是还有吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1027_p", "source_sha256": "8ddd4ea20e5d0d6e5412002e8b7a661b35f23d58b76a4da7970027d2d0222a5a", "ja": "律子こそ、なんでそんなに嫌がるんだ？\nもしかして、自信がないのか？", "zh": "律子你才是，为什么这么不情愿啊？\n难道说，是没有自信吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1028_009rit", "source_sha256": "e7b16c3a2adce2aee2d23c8bd30f6f924d10c9f6b77c9dc61d989f4e8a3041d0", "ja": "いや、自信とかじゃなくてですね。\n私はただ、市場のニーズを考えた上で……。", "zh": "不，不是有没有自信的问题啦。\n我只是考虑到市场需求才……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1029_045kar", "source_sha256": "ed480d1d4f4428ad6e6ad0793ee4444aaaa6c087996d87db28baee6162a1b6af", "ja": "あ、あの、律子さん……！　私、が、がんばります！\nだから、あの……よ、よろしく、お願いします……！", "zh": "啊、那个，律子小姐……！我、我会努力的！所以，那个……请、请多关照……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1030_009rit", "source_sha256": "ab758361f7a4938bf2fbe71f95a6b34d254d54a918d232134c3bb0654e59ab57", "ja": "可憐……。", "zh": "可怜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1031_009rit", "source_sha256": "dab9f5bae2dda5695b2dd7e99ebb6e52491191589503a9ac61ce21659ba18351", "ja": "仕方ないわね。それじゃ、他に候補が見つかるまで、\nとりあえずの代役ってことで。それでいい？", "zh": "真拿你没办法。那就先暂时替补一下，直到找到其他候选人。这样可以吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1032_009rit", "source_sha256": "c13f4c7d8384abf62f046db5fedcbf737fc2d9f221eda2204721f15990fc6c07", "ja": "その代わり！　私が代役を引き受けるからには、\nビシバシいかせてもらうわよ！", "zh": "不过！既然由我来担任替补，可不会手下留情哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1033_045kar", "source_sha256": "6bf43494bcc9e516499228f17747805b10220e62d147e739533b1ba03a9ff7f8", "ja": "は、はい……お、お願いしますっ……！", "zh": "好、好的……那、那就拜托了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1034_p", "source_sha256": "4fd6b027969ff431e57b35b1023cb9406f3afe4afe6e893de3fd1c5171263e1f", "ja": "ああ、それでいいよ。頼んだぞ、律子！", "zh": "啊，这样就行。拜托你了，律子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1035_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1036_009rit", "source_sha256": "9237859be4133cbb646b074f13c25eb84d41c615e8db5aaaae9bb7594e9244b7", "ja": "まずは映像に合わせて、通しでやってみましょう。\n可憐、準備はいい？　しっかりね！", "zh": "首先配合影像，从头到尾练一遍看看吧。\n可怜，准备好了吗？要打起精神来哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1037_p", "source_sha256": "81409ac278b467213f7e3141fb0bb56ecd053f95fffed91204f17004fc3e8989", "ja": "待て待て。どさくさに紛れて、何を指導側に\n回ろうとしてるんだ……律子もやるんだぞ。", "zh": "等等。你少趁乱跑到指导的那一边去\n……律子你也要上啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1038_009rit", "source_sha256": "0b4905f18e633036a17b3b2a6d266067d8cb7bf4a532bc9dd565d5d5b1bdf14f", "ja": "え！？　けど、\n誰かが客観的に見て、アドバイスしたほうが……。", "zh": "诶！？可是，\n还是由别人客观地观察一下，再给出建议比较好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1039_p", "source_sha256": "8e230a5756fb4731f23e827ee08a505a86971dc507c08765adb0399367ae68eb", "ja": "それは俺がやるから大丈夫だ。\nサボらないで、ちゃんとレッスンしような！", "zh": "这件事我来做，没问题。\n别偷懒，好好练习吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1040_009rit", "source_sha256": "50930e4d16829d716d8ac9c946199903f3c83de1f5e149f5b63be572a318af47", "ja": "さ、サボるなんて、人聞きの悪い！　そりゃあ、\nダンスレッスンは得意じゃありませんけど……。", "zh": "我、我才没有偷懒呢，听起来多难听！虽说我确实不擅长舞蹈训练……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1041_045kar", "source_sha256": "e8b32ea62912df8b4ce75983175c27ba28a8d16a38e0f9eb95b6cb8e4d264f3e", "ja": "あ……律子さんでも、サボろうとするんですね……？\nなんだか……ふ、ふふっ……♪", "zh": "啊……原来律子小姐也会想偷懒啊……？\n总觉得……呵、呵呵……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1042_009rit", "source_sha256": "999770ca297f72843acfd8c7b96a6f924480a72a03d7eb1a1d855f0cb71bd04a", "ja": "うっ……も、もうっ、わかりましたよ！\n{$P$}、曲出しお願いします。", "zh": "呜……真、真是的，我知道了啦！\n{$P$}，麻烦放音乐吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1043_009rit", "source_sha256": "c6c6695637b8b9cfc00af67fe2fcb88e0c449f6e87445a26bf4334a6100098f0", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……つ、疲れた……。この曲、\nまさかこんなにキツいとは思わなかったわ……。", "zh": "哈啊、哈啊……累、累死我了……没想到这首歌竟然这么累人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1044_045kar", "source_sha256": "a0ad3d8b9b908ebf8a863e5a3c73d21ebd935659203729de0d098e09dc63390d", "ja": "だ、大丈夫ですか、律子さん……！？", "zh": "没、没事吧，律子小姐……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1045_009rit", "source_sha256": "4ee89f30ecad1a12d3955eae156f15ab501fc50ff83b317ef5c46041ea78c70f", "ja": "ええ、大丈夫よ……はぁ。\nやっぱりアイドルって、甘くないわね……。", "zh": "嗯，我没事……唉。\n果然偶像这条路没那么容易啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0104_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0104_story_02_1046_p", "source_sha256": "82f568e6c0d4bd6553a39404d4aba2f123f0d5841ae5a079a06d7589f6d950e1", "ja": "（可憐も律子も、楽しそうにレッスンが\n進んでよかった。今度の新曲、期待が持てるぞ！）", "zh": "（可怜和律子都练习得很开心，顺利进行下去真是太好了。看来这次的新歌很值得期待啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
